<!doctype html>
<html lang='en'>
	<head>
		<meta charset='UTF-8' />
		<meta name='viewport' content='width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0' />
		<title>Sandbox</title>
	</head>
	<body>
		<h2>components</h2>
		<h3>spacing</h3>
		<div id='spacing-1' class='spacing'></div>
		<div id='spacing-2' class='spacing'></div>
		<div id='spacing-3' class='spacing'></div>
		<div id='spacing-4' class='spacing'></div>
		<div id='spacing-5' class='spacing'></div>
		<div id='spacing-6' class='spacing'>6</div>
		<div id='spacing-8' class='spacing'>8</div>
		<div id='spacing-10' class='spacing'>10</div>
		<div id='spacing-12' class='spacing'>12</div>
		<div id='spacing-14' class='spacing'>14</div>
		<div id='spacing-16' class='spacing'>16</div>
		<div id='spacing-20' class='spacing'>20</div>
		<div id='spacing-24' class='spacing'>24</div>
		<div id='spacing-32' class='spacing'>32</div>
		<h3>colors</h3>
		<div id='ivory' class='colours'></div>
		<div id='red' class='colours'></div>
		<div id='teal' class='colours'></div>
		<div id='petrol' class='colours'></div>
		<div id='graphite' class='colours'></div>
		<div id='amber' class='colours'></div>
		<h3>typography</h3>
		<h4>headings</h4>
		<div class='typography'>
			<h1>Heading 1</h1>
		</div>
		<div class='typography'>
			<h2>Heading 2</h2>
		</div>
		<div class='typography'>
			<h3>Heading 3</h3>
		</div>
		<div class='typography'>
			<h4>Heading 4</h4>
		</div>
		<div class='typography'>
			<h5>Heading 5</h5>
		</div>
		<div class='typography'>
			<h6>Heading 6</h6>
		</div>
		<h4>Prose</h4>
		<p>
			Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Nam eget mauris nunc. Duis vitae bibendum magna,
			nec maximus nisi. Maecenas blandit urna a porta tristique. Donec in venenatis leo, in pellentesque nulla.
			Aliquam consequat nisl mauris. Nam non elit at neque cursus tempor. Cras quis ex rhoncus, eleifend metus
			eget, fermentum arcu. Ut fermentum efficitur lorem, vitae condimentum odio porta nec. Aliquam erat volutpat.
			Quisque et risus arcu. Nam sed auctor mauris, ac convallis odio. Ut ut hendrerit sem. Suspendisse eu
			convallis libero, non maximus nibh. Vestibulum vitae turpis porta, finibus urna sit amet, faucibus eros.
			Nulla vulputate, tellus vitae egestas gravida, ante metus vestibulum.
		</p>
		<p>
			Turpis, at accumsan nulla ipsum sed elit. Maecenas congue enim tellus, eu malesuada lorem rutrum eu.
			Pellentesque dignissim
		</p>
	</body>

	<style lang='scss'>
		@use '../styles/abstracts/spacing';
		@use '../styles/abstracts/colors';
		@use '../styles/abstracts/typography';

		html,
		body,
		p,
		h1,
		h2,
		h3,
		h4,
		h5,
		h6 {
			margin: 0;
			padding: 0;
		}

		body {
			padding: spacing.$space-4;
		}

		.spacing {
			background-color: colors.$red;
		}

		#spacing-1 {
			width: spacing.$space-1;
			height: spacing.$space-1;
		}
		#spacing-2 {
			width: spacing.$space-2;
			height: spacing.$space-2;
		}

		#spacing-3 {
			width: spacing.$space-3;
			height: spacing.$space-3;
			background-color: colors.$red;
		}
		#spacing-4 {
			width: spacing.$space-4;
			height: spacing.$space-4;
		}
		#spacing-5 {
			width: spacing.$space-5;
			height: spacing.$space-5;
		}

		#spacing-6 {
			width: spacing.$space-6;
			height: spacing.$space-6;
		}

		#spacing-8 {
			width: spacing.$space-8;
			height: spacing.$space-8;
		}
		#spacing-10 {
			width: spacing.$space-10;
			height: spacing.$space-10;
		}
		#spacing-12 {
			width: spacing.$space-12;
			height: spacing.$space-12;
		}

		#spacing-14 {
			width: spacing.$space-14;
			height: spacing.$space-14;
		}

		#spacing-16 {
			width: spacing.$space-16;
			height: spacing.$space-16;
		}

		#spacing-20 {
			width: spacing.$space-20;
			height: spacing.$space-20;
		}

		#spacing-24 {
			width: spacing.$space-24;
			height: spacing.$space-24;
		}

		#spacing-32 {
			width: spacing.$space-32;
			height: spacing.$space-32;
		}

		.colours {
			width: spacing.$space-32;
			height: spacing.$space-32;
			display: inline-block;
		}

		#ivory {
			background-color: colors.$ivory;
		}
		#red {
			background-color: colors.$red;
		}
		#teal {
			background-color: colors.$teal;
		}
		#petrol {
			background-color: colors.$petrol;
		}
		#graphite {
			background-color: colors.$graphite;
		}
		#amber {
			background-color: colors.$amber;
		}

		.typography h1,
		.typography h2,
		.typography h3,
		.typography h4,
		.typography h5,
		.typography h6 {
			@include typography.heading-base;
			color: colors.$graphite;
			font-weight: typography.$weight-medium;
			letter-spacing: typography.$tracking-normal;
		}

		.typography h1 {
			font-size: typography.$font-size-6xl;
		}
		.typography h2 {
			font-size: typography.$font-size-5xl;
		}
		.typography h3 {
			font-size: typography.$font-size-4xl;
		}
		.typography h4 {
			font-size: typography.$font-size-3xl;
		}
		.typography h5 {
			font-size: typography.$font-size-2xl;
		}
		.typography h6 {
			font-size: typography.$font-size-xl;
		}
		p {
			@include typography.body-text;
			@include typography.prose;
		}
	</style>
</html>
